---
const faqs = [
  {
    q: 'How much does a consultation cost?',
    a: 'The initial consult is free. We review the operation, name the leaks, and give next steps with no obligation.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Do you work with single-location operators?',
    a: 'Yes. Single sites and multi-site operators. The plan is sized to the tunnel, not a package name.',
  },
  {
    q: 'What areas do you serve?',
    a: 'Based in San Diego (7776 Trade Street). We work with sites across the United States, on-site or remote as needed.',
  },
  {
    q: 'How quickly can we see results?',
    a: 'Chemical and downtime fixes often show within weeks. It depends on water, injectors, and whether PM is already in place.',
  },
  {
    q: 'What types of problems can you help solve?',
    a: 'Over-dosed chemistry, reclaim, unplanned downtime, equipment spec, and cost-per-car that does not hold.',
  },
  {
    q: 'What happens after the consultation?',
    a: 'You get a clear breakdown. Implement it yourself or keep us on for chemistry, equipment, and PM.',
  },
];
---

<section class="cwm-home-section cwm-home-section--alt">
  <div class="cwm-home-wrap" style="max-width:48rem">
    <div class="cwm-home-head">
      <p class="cwm-eyebrow">Questions</p>
      <h2 class="cwm-h2">Before you book.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="cwm-faq-list">
      {faqs.map((f) => (
        <div class="cwm-faq-item" data-faq-item>
          <button type="button" data-faq-btn class="cwm-faq-btn">
            <span>{f.q}</span>
          </button>
          <div data-faq-panel class="cwm-faq-panel" hidden>{f.a}</div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    <div class="cwm-center">
      <a href="/book-a-call" class="cwm-btn-primary cwm-btn-lg">Book a consult</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
